This section introduces the software tools used during the internship and the benchmark system model employed for implementation and validation.

\subsection{Software Stack}
The implementation was carried out entirely in Python, using the following libraries:

\begin{itemize}
\item \textbf{CasADi:} A symbolic framework for automatic differentiation and numerical optimization \cite{casadi-docs}. CasADi was used to define the MPC optimization problem, construct cost functions, impose constraints, and generate efficient solver code.

